+    /// sync scopes, per-peer admission caps, controlled cross-bucket
+    /// borrowing above one-second floors, and deferral (the crate's
+    /// existing backpressure machinery) when neither bucket can serve a
+    /// send above the floors. The split shares ONE hard rate — total
+    /// egress never exceeds the legacy budget.
